# A chat's row held by a finger (sfpages chat_row.mbt): it lifts a little as its time shows, all the way as its menu
# opens (a card over the menu's scrim, under the menu), and comes back down as the menu goes; then a row low on the
# screen, where the menu comes up over it.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
hold 1100 夜里的构建又失败了
wait 1600
back
wait 1400
hold 1100 把旧的截图都换成新的
wait 1600
back
wait 1400
exit
